        "title": "The Ultimate",
        "text": "The Ultimate Shiva Temple in the world!\n\nI have been here twice. This trip was something special as i had arranged before arriving to get a special pooja done.\n\nThe experience was more than just spiritual as you are part of ancient tradition and history. The temple priests are extremely humble and helpful with all requests.\n\nI am planning another visit - hopefully for Shivarathri 2013 - which i believe is the biggest Shivarathri in the world.\n\nThis site comes extremely highly recommended as the temple is well maintained and kept neat and tidy - you will enjoy this temple. Also, read about the tradition and history first - this will enhance your experience of the temple.",
